{
    "title": "Manticore - Cobalt Lancers",
    "kind": "quest",
    "startsWhen": "quest(manticore_khador) == 2",
    "steps": [
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 4
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "title": {
                "en": "MANTICORE - ACT III",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号 - 第三幕"
            },
            "subtitle": {
                "en": "Chapter 10 - Cobalt Lancers",
                "zh": "第十章 - 钴蓝枪骑兵"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Problem. The Cobalt Lancers just arrived at Phoenix Station to 'keep the peace'. Martha says they are searching every ship for Manticore crew.",
                        "zh": "麻烦了。钴蓝枪骑兵刚刚抵达凤凰空间站，说是来“维持和平”。玛莎说他们正在搜查每一艘船，找蝎尾狮号的人。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "Khador",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "They know I am with you. Eclipse does not leave loose ends. She will burn Phoenix to reach me.",
                        "zh": "他们知道我在你们这里。日蚀从不留活口。为了抓我，她会烧掉凤凰站。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Then Phoenix gets the Manticore's protection. Go, ace. And let the whole sector see what the Lancers really are.",
                        "zh": "那凤凰站就由蝎尾狮号来保护。去吧，王牌。让整个星区看看枪骑兵的真面目。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "lancers_briefed"
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix",
            "dock": false,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Fly to Phoenix Station.",
                "zh": "飞往凤凰空间站。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "wait",
            "seconds": 8
        },
        {
            "type": "spawn",
            "ship": 5,
            "race": "terran",
            "count": 2,
            "behaviour": "friendly",
            "name": "Phoenix Militia"
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran Lancer Commander",
            "text": {
                "en": "Manticore pilot, power down and surrender the Grey. This is a lawful peacekeeping action.",
                "zh": "蝎尾狮号飞行员，关闭动力，交出那个灰人。这是合法的维和行动。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Martha Penbury",
            "text": {
                "en": "Lawful? They just fired on a refugee shuttle! Manticore, help us!",
                "zh": "合法？他们刚刚向一艘难民穿梭机开火！蝎尾狮号，救救我们！"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Cobalt Lancer",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 22,
                    "count": 3,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                },
                {
                    "ship": 28,
                    "count": 1,
                    "race": "terran",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Fight off the Cobalt Lancers.",
                "zh": "击退钴蓝枪骑兵。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
            "text": {
                "en": "I'm broadcasting their gun-camera footage to every station in Trim. The 'peacekeepers' are shooting civilians.",
                "zh": "我正把他们的枪机录像广播到特里姆的每一座空间站。“维和者”在向平民开火。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "fight",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix",
            "quiet": false,
            "name": "Indigo Raider",
            "ships": [
                {
                    "ship": 54,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                },
                {
                    "ship": 9,
                    "count": 2,
                    "race": "pirate",
                    "behaviour": "enemy"
                }
            ],
            "objective": {
                "en": "Destroy the green raiders behind them.",
                "zh": "消灭他们身后的绿色袭击者。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "questorbit",
            "station": "manticore_neox:phoenix",
            "on": false
        },
        {
            "type": "radio",
            "speaker": "terran female Martha Penbury",
            "text": {
                "en": "Green Vossk-style ships with an eight-ball mark. Those were Indigo Brink, not Lancers. Same people, two coats of paint.",
                "zh": "绿色的沃斯克式飞船，带着八号球标志。那是靛蓝深渊，不是枪骑兵。同一伙人，两层油漆。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "reward",
            "credits": 22000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Phoenix protected",
                "zh": "凤凰得到保护"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "name": "phoenix_saved"
        },
        {
            "type": "goto",
            "station": "manticore_neox:manticore",
            "dock": true,
            "objective": {
                "en": "Return to the Manticore.",
                "zh": "返回蝎尾狮号。"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "dialog",
            "pages": [
                {
                    "speaker": "Khador",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Indigo Brink was born in the Rigant Vortex. Its heart is the Eye, an old station inside the anomaly. Eclipse plans everything from there.",
                        "zh": "靛蓝深渊诞生于瑞甘特漩涡。它的核心是“漩涡之眼”，漩涡里的一座旧空间站。日蚀在那里策划一切。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran female Jalen",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "The Vortex scrambles navigation. But the route opens from Survey Main in Porros, and refugees at Driftwood Refuge can guide us in.",
                        "zh": "漩涡会扰乱导航。不过航线从波罗斯的勘测总站开通，浮木避难站的难民可以给我们带路。"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "terran Bryce Vantok",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Into the Vortex, then. This is where they ambushed us the first time. Not again.",
                        "zh": "那就进漩涡。他们第一次伏击我们就是在那里。不会再有第二次了。"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "complete",
            "reward": 10000,
            "title": {
                "en": "Chapter 10 complete",
                "zh": "第十章 完成"
            }
        }
    ]
}
